WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.564
Day 6. I See a Cat.

2
00:00:02.014 --> 00:00:09.026
Watch first. The first one on the page is written for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:09.526 --> 00:00:12.534
Look at the first picture. Say the whole sentence together.

4
00:00:12.984 --> 00:00:17.711
Your child writes the word for the picture on the line, then reads the whole sentence back.

5
00:00:18.311 --> 00:00:20.186
If a word is spelled wrong, leave it.

6
00:00:20.636 --> 00:00:24.597
Ask your child to read it back. If you can read it, it is a sentence.
